* HVOA-1 : +/-40 V discrete op-amp, nested (bootstrapped + VAS) cascode.
* Pins: INP INN OUT VP VN GND
* Variant A1 (hi-Z input): rtail=3k rsink=10k re=1k cc=68p
* Variant A2 (FX return): rtail=820 rsink=3.3k re=470 cc=150p
.subckt HVOA INP INN OUT VP VN GND params: rtail=820 rsink=3.3k re=470 cc=150p
* --- references -------------------------------------------------------
* top reference (red LED ~1.7 V below +V)
D101 VP REFP LEDRED
R101 REFP GND 39k
C101 VP REFP 10u
* bottom reference (red LED ~1.7 V above -V)
D102 REFN VN LEDRED
R102 GND REFN 39k
C102 REFN VN 10u
* --- input pair: 2N5087, degenerated, bootstrapped cascode --------------
Q103 TAIL REFP E103 MPSA92
R103 VP E103 {rtail}
R104 TAIL E1 {re}
R105 TAIL E2 {re}
Q1 C1 INN E1 2N5087
Q2 C2 INP E2 2N5087
* cascode base rides 5.6 V below the tail node -> Vce(Q1,Q2) ~ 4.7 V at any common mode
D103 CASB TAIL DZ5V6
Q104 CASB REFN E104 MPSA42
R106 E104 VN {rsink}
C103 TAIL CASB 100n
Q3 M1 CASB C1 MPSA92
Q4 M2 CASB C2 MPSA92
* --- current mirror: 2N5210, degenerated --------------------------------
Q5 M1 M1 E5 2N5210
Q6 M2 M1 E6 2N5210
R107 E5 VN 1k
R108 E6 VN 1k
* --- VAS: MPSA42 follower (collector to GND) + 2N5210 VAS, MPSA42 cascode --
D104 VN VCR DZ3V3
R109 GND VCR 33k
C104 VCR VN 10u
Q7 GND M2 V7 MPSA42
R110 V7 VN 22k
Q8 V8 V7 E8 2N5210
R111 E8 VN 100
* VAS current limit (~6 mA)
Q15 V7 E8 VN 2N5210
Q9 VASL VCR V8 MPSA42
* VAS load: MPSA92 current source ~3.9 mA
Q105 VASH REFP E105 MPSA92
R112 VP E105 270
* --- dominant-pole compensation ----------------------------------------
CC VASL M2 {cc}
* --- bias chain + complementary emitter-follower output ----------------
D105 VASH B1 D1N4148
D106 B1 B2 D1N4148
R113 B2 VASL 100
Q11 VP VASH E11 MPSA42
Q12 VN VASL E12 MPSA92
R114 E11 OUT 56
R115 E12 OUT 56
* output current limit (~11 mA)
Q13 VASH E11 OUT MPSA42
Q14 VASL E12 OUT MPSA92
.ends HVOA
